[{"title":"喜新会学沃掌教违众不远四百里来过甘泉归似何明府何如也","author":"湛若水","text":"时辈纷纷反眼轻，白头谁鼓铁江?。\n故人族子知多少，惟有当年尹彦明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邑城西郭巷下街屋一间切近汤子新之因卖与之诗以代券","author":"湛若水","text":"比邻西郭一鸡飞，小栋明诚十步违。\n卖与汤郎知有意，藩篱通了即书帏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57987,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其一 朱明洞","author":"湛若水","text":"谩品朱明七洞天，论人论智不论年。\n丹青不解传神去，但写崖泉百丈悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57988,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其二 青霞洞","author":"湛若水","text":"青霞真人乘鹤去，洞口封霞空自青。\n又有真人来卜筑，虾蟆峰下说生生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其三 黄龙洞","author":"湛若水","text":"百丈崖头更问源，珊珊流水铁桥前。\n飞云忽被风吹散，万树桃花锦一川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其四 天华洞","author":"湛若水","text":"觉山泽山同爱山，春来不来春又残。\n四贤祠宇天华上，司马行窝亦扁颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其五 飞云顶","author":"湛若水","text":"飞空直上飞云顶，踏断铁桥无路还。\n公还不还心亦死，纵上无山意未阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其六 小石楼","author":"湛若水","text":"小石桥居天小脩，藤萝十丈缀悬旒。\n玉玉割与蓬莱股，流落于今在海陬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其七 大石楼","author":"湛若水","text":"大石楼居天大脩，玲珑积翠空中浮。\n楼下王孙今不见，斜阳输与落軥辀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山大巡罗浮八咏 其八 铁桥","author":"湛若水","text":"铁桥桥下水翻飞，信步吾行行不疑。\n童子隔溪闻对语，公今是稳是危时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山侍御江门钧台之作因以赠别二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"孤鸾操罢千山暮，独屿空馀一老吟。\n留与钓台无限意，铁江江水不如深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵姚泽山侍御江门钧台之作因以赠别二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"无事持竿八十年，有人炼石补天穿。\n登台不尽相思处，望断停云踏藓钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还宿罗浮用前韵二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"三时病里妨幽事，万仞峰头恣朗吟。\n处处鸟啼芳树里，千千石转白云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还宿罗浮用前韵二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"大舜深山茹草年，荣公带索无衣穿。\n携家定遂庞公计，旧买烟霞不费钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":57999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以建古冚山代券付曾我山唯卿进士收管","author":"湛若水","text":"建古山深吾对关，住城正在碧云间。\n亦知曾子传忠孝，割与云山与我山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次大学士方樵翁用濂溪韵开金牛洞之作三首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"喜为名山添好人，万重云水自由身。\n世间梦尽都知幻，只有元初一念真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次大学士方樵翁用濂溪韵开金牛洞之作三首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"江山由我不由人，由我方为自在身。\n高处振衣还洗耳，落花啼鸟尽天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次大学士方樵翁用濂溪韵开金牛洞之作三首 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"且免攒眉对俗人，青山为枕云为身。\n这回便得从吾乐，事事从吾事事真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登飞云顶用濂溪韵三首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"何其帝允乞馀年，有分天教作地仙。\n绝境未穷心未死，诸天之外有诸天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登飞云顶用濂溪韵三首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"丹方传得已多年，未脱凡胎骨未仙。\n末路偶逢仙侣话，相期直入无穷天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登飞云顶用濂溪韵三首 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"自笑衰翁八十年，飞云顶上访群仙。\n天风吹衣白日暮，两手捉笠行中天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰八月九日自西樵发南岳舟十二夜泊清远东林寺作","author":"湛若水","text":"东林寺傍看月眠，月光水色浑同天。\n此时好景说不得，不是吾心未发前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三日午游登清远峡飞来寺","author":"湛若水","text":"归时曾憩半云亭，屈指于今越几星。\n重到肃容看老树，人传此树阅人灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过大庙峡有感","author":"湛若水","text":"文敏曾祛太庙祠，一时祛去广人疑。\n如今妖怪寰区满，争得斯人一扫之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风宿峡中","author":"湛若水","text":"波心怪石波涛生，万斛之舟不敢行。\n系舟寂寂惊风怒，伏枕漫漫听雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至清溪观潮水山灵泉作","author":"湛若水","text":"清溪流泉天下奇，变化疾徐人叵知。\n泉头尽日观生坐，翕辟天机天所为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至虎榜山作怀岳诗","author":"湛若水","text":"西游脚底是青天，身世萧条似老禅。\n人世万缘挥手谢，五峰明月抱云眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至韶州观曲江武溪二水合流","author":"湛若水","text":"庾郴岭下合为流，到海滔滔势未休。\n尽道源头山下出，岂知升降与沈浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郴江口见江岸野生芙蓉","author":"湛若水","text":"江岸芙蓉如盛妆，花光为色叶为裳。\n不妨远地无人采，独自临风弄晚芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耒阳道中见白鸟卑飞掠船先去若有意者","author":"湛若水","text":"有鸟翩翩贴水飞，掠船历历度斜晖。\n探看何处神君使，碧玉为髀白锦衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过圆沙洲望岳","author":"湛若水","text":"怀岳于今五十年，丹青形影梦中传。\n今朝独立船头望，神色何如未见前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至衡州作怀祝岣嵝宪副","author":"湛若水","text":"岣嵝相期岣嵝峰，我来双袖驭天风。\n书堂独锁人何在，云隔巫山几万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壁虱自讼","author":"湛若水","text":"壁风豺狼皆齧人，嗟予有患有吾身。\n直须坐到无身处，无我无人无怨嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳日同骆君举登朱陵洞最高处题名","author":"湛若水","text":"方头路滑不可度，我来跨鹤御天风。\n喷泉九月飞□冷，举袖擎天晓日红。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月初一日衡岳居成作","author":"湛若水","text":"为姊煮粥弟燎须，为弟作粥姊供书。\n情事百年浑未报，一年除半到衡庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永新诸生尹克恭龙诚史鸣辞归赠之诗","author":"湛若水","text":"三五青衿破紫云，循循言自艾陵君。\n独怜岁晚归期逼，半载西铭未讲闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送禾川左孟和埙宋景贤沆登祝融因答其问","author":"湛若水","text":"步步青天步步云，乃谁能者是天君。\n若言阶级超凡事，青玉坛前月下闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方广寺僧圆林送藤竹二杖作","author":"湛若水","text":"方竹红藤来上方，入手振之声琅琅。\n天台有路终须到，只在衰翁柱杖傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访周生自正阳清洞别业用周和靖韵","author":"湛若水","text":"阳清高与太清俱，朱也相从别业居。\n若借半间云共卧，不知何处是吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月初七早还与县尹章碧湖","author":"湛若水","text":"广宴高轩送短亭，碧湖深似碧湖情。\n临岐问我还山日，驾鹤驱云更出迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中寄督学蒋道林与留山居罗覃宋诸子","author":"湛若水","text":"内顾传声与道林，留居诸子快登临。\n此中真境无穷在，一洞无如一洞深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹轩卷为约宾曹凤朝文瑞","author":"湛若水","text":"卜得云居岂偶然，地藏天作乃神存。\n有人任了经营事，终日无为对竹轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承应谨庵督学置酒请会于石鼓书院作","author":"湛若水","text":"衡云烂睡六十日，江雨痛饮蒸湘头。\n含情吊古忘言说，石鼓无声江自流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与衡州守冯南滨","author":"湛若水","text":"廛地新占天柱峰，今人冷淡古人同。\n黄堂已有陈蕃榻，白屋无能孺子风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承冯南滨太守丁巨川少府崔柏溪别驾饯于回雁寺作诗酬之","author":"湛若水","text":"□□挥毫回雁峰，一翁五马二骖同。\n片云去逐啼鸣□，□马驰驱别驾风。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与彭西湖典膳诗","author":"湛若水","text":"无虞即鹿入林中，阮籍惟应哭路穷。\n行尽源头见真境，西湖歌鼓笑相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至桂阳州作","author":"湛若水","text":"风驭云车天与游，天风吹过桂阳州。\n未知城郭人文别，分付诗囊一并收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀居岳诸子","author":"湛若水","text":"几望归途踏月歌，满腔春意柰公何。\n诸贤收拾知深浅，衡岳峰头月最多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过界茅岭答人言","author":"湛若水","text":"舆卒俄而向我言，广东湖广界茅分。\n而今已自通疆界，东洞云同西洞云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过星子巡司倩小船东下中流赋诗甚适云","author":"湛若水","text":"千层石罅挂云軘，万劫危途见雾村。\n孤寨人言是星子，中流我自出星源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜半至连州有诗与况知州","author":"湛若水","text":"一水中流两岸山，满船明月只身还。\n故人问我来何处，笑指衡云天际间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过鳖子峡作","author":"湛若水","text":"鳖予峡中孤舸飞，寒花两岸送吾归。\n不须傍柳寻花去，自有花光映客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜过横石矶驿玩月作","author":"湛若水","text":"横石矶头月满身，天青月白白于银。\n莫言旧日寻常路，一度经过一度新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清远与李廷清","author":"湛若水","text":"先时此梦报庭清，微服西游计已成。\n今古此机神莫测，老夫直欲废将迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟至西南将还甘泉先如西樵以观云谷","author":"湛若水","text":"已穷洞府无穷意，不尽幽期未了缘。\n取道西樵看云谷，徐从此滘达甘泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广衡诗","author":"湛若水","text":"广衡二府地相连，朱明朱陵同一天。\n两间今已通云破，天纵衰□取次眠。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其一 见日亭","author":"湛若水","text":"见日亭前有所思，祝融看日五更时。\n一泓本体凉如水，五色祥云拥护之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其二 观海亭","author":"湛若水","text":"石泉乍见已涓涓，到此凭栏望虎门。\n人世但闻川上叹，谁从大海问真源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其三 仁智堂","author":"湛若水","text":"乐山乐水亦人情，仁智元来一体成。\n不用游人更分别，诸天踏遍又蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其四 面壁亭","author":"湛若水","text":"九年面壁须忘壁，到了忘时又著忘。\n忘与不忘真体见，山风吹动薜萝裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其五 休休亭","author":"湛若水","text":"常欲休休未得休，直须见道与天游。\n道中实体无休处，何必憧憧起念头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访李鳌峰别驾于西台遍观胜景乐而有作六首 其六 瑞光堂","author":"湛若水","text":"坡老嘐嘐说瑞光，谩誇北斗共光芒。\n道人自有神光在，夜夜明珠海底藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承陈瑞山侍御閒顾江门钓台次石翁韵留诗将还朝也予以奉赠 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"老来老去元无事，江月江风他自吟。\n邂逅千里云水外，相看一笑暮烟深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承陈瑞山侍御閒顾江门钓台次石翁韵留诗将还朝也予以奉赠 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"虚度舜日与尧年，惭愧东归木榻穿。\n白日绣衣来驻桨，荒蹊今始破苔钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇与李庭清 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"岳道微行清远时，馆人先梦泄天机。\n相逢记得庭清语，古寺东林月色辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇与李庭清 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"芦花杳杳送风凉，云谷深深引兴长。\n九十六峰留我住，忘归不记是他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺大中丞张静峰征广之东西两收奇功二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"两鼓闻收两峒功，旌麾摇映广西东。\n于今已定筹边策，他日麟台又属公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺大中丞张静峰征广之东西两收奇功二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"斧钺亲临柳庆营，潢池赤子合收兵。\n若教孟子论功载，归马华山是武成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58053,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺平江伯陈竹泉总戎两广奏功","author":"湛若水","text":"平江恭襄代有名，赋诗横槊不谈兵。\n百年文武传家学，经略元戎始有成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58054,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐居西樵三日吟二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"三日长扃天路关，朱明朱陵只尺间。\n坐破云烟皆我闼，不知何处是吾山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58055,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐居西樵三日吟二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"三日一开天路关，烟霞云谷非人间。\n两洞风光相表里，两生一老万重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58056,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟筑一卧室于濆玉岩水帘之侧","author":"湛若水","text":"喷玉岩前第一关，岩泉还拟屋三间。\n兴来傍柳随花去，不落前川以下山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58057,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大有洞天月下吟前韵","author":"湛若水","text":"大有洞天天上关，迢迢天路隔人间。\n手攀明月有几尺，海岸孤绝此何山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58058,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵山行示周生学心刘生廷绎周生荣穗谢生锡命","author":"湛若水","text":"四子宜将四辅看，上山扶上万寻峦。\n万寻峦上千寻石，撒手应知著步难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":58059,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]